The truly “perfect” version of WORLD // NEXUS isn't merely a gigantic database or a planetary map.


It is a verifiable, uncertainty-aware computational model of changing reality.


And I would make one additional architectural rule absolute:




Never overwrite the world. Append observations, assertions, corrections, interpretations, and contradictions.




That single rule makes the bitemporal model, provenance system, confidence vectors, conflict engine, historical reconstruction, and cryptographic verification all fit together naturally.

